{"turn_id": "language-2", "session_id": "mem-language", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_comparison", "text": "作者将Google Translate的代词性别翻译统计与美国劳工统计局（BLS）数据进行了对比，该数据包含各职业类别中女性参与的比例。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation_finding", "text": "作者将女性工人的分布与女性翻译的频率进行比较，发现这两个变量之间没有相关性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "gt_fails_real_world", "text": "作者报告称，Google Translate的输出未能反映女性工人在各类职位上的真实世界分布，低估了预期频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "data_scope_us_bls", "text": "用于比较的性别分布数据来自美国劳工统计局，涉及美国职业类别，而非来自使用性别中性语言的国家。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "language-2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": null, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
