{"turn_id": "language-8", "session_id": "mem-language", "turn": 8, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_us_data_only", "text": "作者用于比较的女性工作者比例数据来自美国劳工统计局（U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics），涉及各职业类别中女性参与百分比。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "neutral_languages_used_as_input", "text": "性别中性语言（如匈牙利语、中文、约鲁巴语等12种语言）被用于构造“He/She is an Engineer”等句子作为翻译输入。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "no_country_of_neutral_languages", "text": "所提供的证据中没有显示作者考察了使用这些性别中性语言的国家或地区内部女性工作者的真实分布；比较对象是BLS的美国职业数据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-bf50e77dea8722dc9d0a44b4"}]}, {"key": "comparison_method", "text": "作者将女性工作者的分布与女性翻译的频率进行比较，以检验男性默认是否仅反映职场中的性别分布不均。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "language-8", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": null, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
